# Root .env.example
#
# There is no root application config. The API is the Cloudflare Worker in workers/,
# and Express (backend/) is retired.
#
#   Worker (local dev + secrets) : workers/.dev.vars.example  -> copy to workers/.dev.vars
#   Frontend       .example      ->copy to frontend/.env
#   Migration comma-migrations.md(DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED and
#                  _* guards, set percommand, never committed)
#
# Never commit real values.
